    "turn_text": "Perhaps the fact that I love to bake. And I find it a stress reliever and also something I really enjoy. I grew up in a home where my mother was safe. Fabulous cook just fabulous and my specialty now is muffins because they don't take that much time to make and the ones that I maker so much healthier than the ones that you can find the grocery store. And I love, of course, making all sorts of blueberry muffins with wild main blueberries. My mother's recipe is still the best, but I have several variations on it. And I love making an oatmeal cranberry muffin, all sorts of muffins. So probably that's something that most people don't know about.",
